3", "visualStatus": "verified"}, {"bookPages": [56, 57], "note": "习题 2.13/2.17 的化简与检验要求", "pdfPages": [70, 71], "sourceId": "SRC-TB", "versionId": "VER-SRC-TB-d1bc6409752a", "visualStatus": "verified"}], "summary": "代数法化简依据公理和定理，常用技巧是提取公因子、补项和消去冗余变量。", "themeId": "TH-07"}, "revision": 2, "deleted": false}, {"namespace": "knowledge", "key": "Q-106", "value": {"answerNature": "official-solution", "hasOfficialAnswer": true, "id": "Q-106", "kind": "exercise-example", "label": "【4】②", "parentId": "Q-104", "questionTypes": ["函数化简"], "solution": "官方答案（习题课第8页）并展开理由：原式F=A¬BCD+AB¬C¬D+A¬B+A¬D+A¬BC。先用A¬B吸收A¬BCD与A¬BC，剩F=A¬B+AB¬C¬D+A¬D。 AB¬C¬D的全部1又被A¬D覆盖，故F=A¬B+A¬D。 m11(1011)只能由A¬B覆盖，m14(1110)只能由A¬D覆盖。全部质蕴含恰是这两项，均必要，得到2项/4文字的最简SOP。两输入AND各求一项，输出接OR，B、D先经非门。", "sourceId": "SRC-EX07", "sourceRefs": [{"note": "习题课第 8 页【4】", "pdfPages": [8], "sourceId": "SRC-EX07", "versionId": "VER-SRC-EX07-94ba9b89b204", "visualStatus": "verified"}], "stem": "【4】② 用代数法化简F=A¬BCD+AB¬C¬D+A¬B+A¬D+A¬BC。", "taskSummary": "用代数法化简【4】②。"}, "revision": 2, "deleted": false}, {"namespace": "knowledge", "key": "Q-107", "value": {"answerNature": "official-solution", "hasOfficialAnswer": true, "id": "Q-107", "kind": "exercise-example", "label": "【4】③", "parentId": "Q-104", "questionTypes": ["函数化简"], "solution": "官方答案（习题课第8页）并展开理由：原式F=ABC¬D+ABD+BC¬D+ABCD+B¬C。BC¬D吸收ABC¬D，ABD吸收ABCD，得F=ABD+BC¬D+B¬C。 BC¬D+B¬C=B(C¬D+¬C)=B(¬C+¬D)=B¬C+B¬D，因此F=ABD+B¬D+B¬C。 ABD+B¬D=B(AD+¬D)=B(A+¬D)=AB+B¬D，故F=AB+B¬C+B¬D。 全部质蕴含只有AB、B¬C、B¬D；m15只由AB覆盖，m5只由B¬C覆盖，m6只由B¬D覆盖，三项均必要。最简SOP为3项/6文字，用三个两输入AND汇入OR，C、D先取反。", "sourceId": "SRC-EX07", "sourceRefs": [{"note": "习题课第 8 页【4】", "pdfPages": [8], "sourceId": "SRC-EX07", "versionId": "VER-SRC-EX07-94ba9b89b204", "visualStatus": "verified"}], "stem": "【4】③ 用代数法化简F=ABC¬D+ABD+BC¬D+ABCD+B¬C。", "taskSummary": "用代数法化简【4】③。"}, "revision": 2, "deleted": false}], "packageId": "CP-TH-07-c0ba618bc502d882", "unitIds": ["KU-032", "KU-033"], "status": "imported"}
